# Tensile

A clean, educational reverse-mode automatic differentiation and deep learning framework written from scratch using **pure NumPy** (Python 3.10+).

## Quickstart

```bash
# Install in editable mode
pip install -e .

# Run numerical gradient checks
pytest tests/test_gradcheck.py

# Run synthetic MNIST training example
python examples/train_mnist_synthetic.py
```
